 out of 6 total outcomes. P(5) = 1/6</div></div><div class=\"rag-question\" data-correct=\"0\"><p><strong>Q3.</strong> A bag contains 10 identical objects, of which 9 are black ball. If one object is drawn at random, what is the probability it is a black ball?</p><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 9/10</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 1/10</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 9/1</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 10/9</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: A</strong> — P(black ball) = favorable / total = 9/10</div></div><div class=\"rag-question\" data-correct=\"3\"><p><strong>Q4.</strong> A bag contains 7 identical objects, of which 4 are black ball. If one object is drawn at random, what is the probability it is a black ball?</p><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 3/7</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 4/3</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 7/4</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 4/7</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: D</strong> — P(black ball) = favorable / total = 4/7</div></div><div class=\"rag-question\" data-correct=\"2\"><p><strong>Q5.</strong> A bag contains 9 identical objects, of which 2 are yellow ball. If one object is drawn at random, what is the probability it is a yellow ball?</p><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 7/9</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 2/7</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 2/9</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 9/2</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: C</strong> — P(yellow ball) = favorable / total = 2/9</div></div></div>','grade10_math.pdf, page 63','Approved','2026-05-21 14:38:21','grade10_math',63,10,0,0),(27,5,'Practice: probablity','<div class=\"rag-explanation\"><h3>Curriculum Overview</h3><p>Unit 1: Relations an