rce</span><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 88</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 8</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 88/5</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 29</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: C</strong> — Mean = (8 + 9 + 29 + 13 + 29) / 5 = 88/5 = 88/5</div></div><div class=\"rag-question\" data-correct=\"3\"><p><strong>Q5.</strong> Find the median of: 2, 8, 12, 16, 17</p><span class=\"rag-src-tag\">Source: Curriculum Source</span><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 17</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 2</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 12</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 12</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: D</strong> — Arrange in order: [2, 8, 12, 16, 17]. Median = 12 (the middle value)</div></div><div class=\"rag-question\" data-correct=\"1\"><p><strong>Q6.</strong> Find the median of: 3, 3, 7, 10, 11</p><span class=\"rag-src-tag\">Source: Curriculum Source</span><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 11</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 7</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 7</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 3</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: B</strong> — Arrange in order: [3, 3, 7, 10, 11]. Median = 7 (the middle value)</div></div><div class=\"rag-question\" data-correct=\"1\"><p><strong>Q7.</strong> Find the mean of: 11, 19, 25, 26, 16</p><span class=\"rag-src-tag\">Source: Curriculum Source</span><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 97</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 97/5</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 11</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 26</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: B</strong> — Mean = (11 + 19 + 25 + 26 