(2x) / (2x)</p><span class=\"rag-src-tag\">Source: Curriculum Source</span><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 0</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 2</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 1/2</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 1</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: D</strong> — Using the standard limit lim(u→0) sin(u)/u = 1, with u = 2x, the answer is 1</div></div><div class=\"rag-question\" data-correct=\"0\"><p><strong>Q2.</strong> Evaluate:  lim(x → 1)  (x + 3)</p><span class=\"rag-src-tag\">Source: Curriculum Source</span><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 4</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 1</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 3</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 5</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: A</strong> — Direct substitution: 1 + 3 = 4</div></div><div class=\"rag-question\" data-correct=\"1\"><p><strong>Q3.</strong> Evaluate:  lim(x → 1)  (x + 6)</p><span class=\"rag-src-tag\">Source: Curriculum Source</span><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 8</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 7</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 1</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 6</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: B</strong> — Direct substitution: 1 + 6 = 7</div></div><div class=\"rag-question\" data-correct=\"0\"><p><strong>Q4.</strong> Evaluate:  lim(x → 3)  (x² - 9) / (x - 3)</p><span class=\"rag-src-tag\">Source: Curriculum Source</span><ul class=\"rag-options\"><li data-idx=\"0\" class=\"rag-option\">A. 6</li><li data-idx=\"1\" class=\"rag-option\">B. 9</li><li data-idx=\"2\" class=\"rag-option\">C. 3</li><li data-idx=\"3\" class=\"rag-option\">D. 5</li></ul><div class=\"rag-answer\" style=\"display:none\"><strong>Answer: A</strong> — Factor numerator: (x-3)(x